                                "sense_id": "b56f8235-4d4c-394d-a93f-a455c11b1022",
                                "text": "[…] the high trapeze \"kinkers\" go through their \"flying\" act; but in a montage treatment of filming the children's trip to the circus, it could be used with striking effect as a comment on their imitation of the thrilling action."
                            },
